| **Indigo as primary accent** | Neutral authority color; avoids red/green bias on main elements |
| **Green for APAC & Churn** | Reinforces the two strongest positive signals immediately |
| **Amber for Europe** | Communicates "watch" without alarming — it's still +12% growth |
| **Bubble chart for strategy matrix** | Encodes 4 dimensions simultaneously: position, size, color, label |
| **Data quality banner** | Transparent communication builds trust; prevents misinterpretation |
| **Sparkline on enterprise deals** | Implies trajectory even where only one data point is confirmed |
